│ │                                                                          │ │
│ │   Goal: Cache each session's token counts so the rail can show them      │ │
│ │   without reading the transcript again.                                  │ │
│ │                                                                          │ │
│ │   Architecture:                                                          │ │
│ │                                                                          │ │
│ │     • A  Counts  store keeps one entry per session id.                   │ │
│ │     • The hook handler writes it and the rail only reads it.             │ │
